---
/**
 * Stands in for every other component in this folder when the guide-funnel flow is off.
 *
 * Astro puts a component's CSS and script into every page that imports it, whether or not the
 * component renders. So in the default 'dialog' flow astro.config.mjs points each import of a
 * guides/Guide*.astro component here, and the default pages carry none of the new flow's CSS or
 * JavaScript (the guide-funnel flow is a build-time choice, see docs/GUIDE-FLOW.md). This renders
 * nothing and ignores whatever props it is given.
 */
---
